  "description": "Want some speed at a great price? With the Pro SL 105 we present you a full-grown marathon bike for pocket money! Everything here is based on a spectacular frame - made of torsion-resistant aluminium with elegantly polished seams - it weighs less than 1,300 grams. The high-end fork made of high-strength carbon is just as professional-like, for even more performance! We have equipped the road bike with a current Shimano 105 group. For a long time now, it has marked the entry into serious racing; functionality and handling hardly leave anything to be desired. The bike’s high-quality wheels are from the Swiss manufacturer DT Swiss. P1800 Spline is the exact designation of the system wheelset, which comes with fast Continental Ultra Sport III tyres. A light saddle from Selle Italia with the name X3 Flow as well as reasonable hardware from Ritchey complete the great impression. ¹ approx. 8.5 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for mandarin red frame colour, size 57 cm, without pedals",
